Fix the paths advertised by the installed pkg-config file: upstream hardcodes
${prefix}/lib and ${prefix}/include instead of using the directories computed by
GNUInstallDirs, which breaks every distribution that installs libraries into
/usr/lib64.

Index: libad9361-iio-0.4.0/libad9361.pc.cmakein
===================================================================
--- libad9361-iio-0.4.0.orig/libad9361.pc.cmakein
+++ libad9361-iio-0.4.0/libad9361.pc.cmakein
@@ -1,8 +1,8 @@
 prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
 exec_prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
-libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib
-sharedlibdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib
-includedir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@/include
+libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@
+sharedlibdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@
+includedir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR@
 
 Name: libad9361
 Description: Device specific library for AD936X transceivers
